      "location": {
        "known": true,
        "value": "Caelid : Ash of War: Rain of Arrows appears at edge of a cliff after you've looted the \"Redmane\" Painting in Sellia, Town of Sorcery . You'll find it down the cliff on a plateau south east of the Minor Erdtree in Caelid. Once you've made your way down, walk to the edge and you'll briefly see the spirit of a painter, he'll vanish and the Ash of War will appear in his place. [ Elden Ring Map Link ]",
